    "text": "1. The Motor Traffic (Fees) Regulations 2011, published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1722/27 of September 9, 2011,as amended by regulations published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1796/22 of February 8, 2013 are hereby furtheramended as follows :",
