    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2) Where an application for registratin is not sumbitted within fourteen days of the change of possession of amotor vehicle upon voluntary transfer made by the registered owne, an additional delay charge for each foregone day shallbe charged along with the fee payable. The payable additional delay charge for each forgone day for the categories specifiedin Column I of Schedule IIIA to these regulations shall be as specified in corresponding entry of Column II of thatSchedule. However the maximum additional delay charge shall not exceed the charge specified in the corresponding entryof Column III of that Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      188.65,
      547.28,
      259.72
    ],
    "text": "(3) Where an application for registration is not submitted within one hundred and eighty days of the change ofpossession of a motor vehicle upon the death of the registered owner of the vehicle, an additional delay charge for eachforegone day shall be charged along with the fee payable. The payable additional delay charge for each forgone day for thecategories specified in Column I of Schedule IIIA to these regulations shall be specified in corresponding entry of ColumnII of that Schedule. However, the maximum additional delay charge shall not exceed the charge specified in the correspondingentry of Column III of that Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      272.65,
      547.3,
      355.72
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, an application for registration is submitted within thirty days of a courts order consequenceto due testimonial proceedings of the deceased registered owner no additional delay charge shall be charged. An applicationfor registration is submitted after thirty days of such court order, an additional delay charge for each foregone day shallbe charged along with the fee payable. The payable additional delay charge for each forgone day for the categories specifiedin Column I of Schedule IIIA to these regulations shall be as specified in corresponding entry of Column II of thatschedule. However, the maximum additional delay charge shall not exceed the charge specified in the corresponding entryof Column III of that Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      368.65,
      547.32,
      451.72
    ],
    "text": "(4) Upon the sale of a vehicle belonging to the State or to a Semi-Governmental Organization or to the the SriLanka Customs an application for registration shall be submitted within one hundred and eighty days of such sale. Anapplication for registration is submitted after one hundred and eighty days of such sale, an additional delay charge for eachforegone day shall be charged along with the fee payable. The payable additional delay charge for each forgone day for thecategories specified in Column I of Schedule IIIA to these regulations shall be as specified in corresponding entry ofColumn II of that Schedule. However, the maximum additional delay charge shall not exceed the charge specified in thecorresponding entry of Column III of that Schedule.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
